<title>LITHUANIA: HANSAPANK SEEKS LITHUANIA DIRECTOR OF TRADING.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK SEEKS LITHUANIA DIRECTOR OF TRADING.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Hansapank Markets is looking for a director of trading in Lithuania, an advertisement published in Lietuvos Rytas said on Friday.</p>
<p>The responsibilities of the director will include building up securities trading and settlement operations and the promotion of the Lithuanian securities market to international clients of the bank.</p>
<p>Hansapank said in March that it was planning to open an office in Lithuania to trade stocks. It has also said that it wants to start full banking operations there.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
